Open Vanilla 0061: the Duels pit (OpenVanilla/DuelsPit.h). Everything around the open duels in Gurubashi Arena, the
Duels hangout, with or without the queue (OpenVanilla.Duels.Pit = 1; hetzner/duels_up.sh sets it):
  the record: every hangout duel counts (wins, losses, streaks, Duel Points) when the two are different accounts on
    different networks, 5 a day against the same opponent; duels_pit, and each fight in duels_pit_result (website);
  the announcer (DA lines to everyone in the hangout): wins, streaks at 3/5/10..., ended streaks, challenges;
  the cards: the opponent card when a duel is offered (Spell::EffectDuel), the 3-2-1 countdown (the accept), the
    result with each side's damage and healing (Unit::DealDamage, Unit::DealHeal);
  winner stays on: join the line; the champion and the next in line are put in the middle of the pit and the duel
    starts by itself (health, mana and cooldowns reset); the loser goes to the back;
  the crowd: spectators summoned in the stands (creatures 900120-900123, realm/duels/duels_world.sql) cheer finishes;
  the hourly brawl: a 3-minute free-for-all for those who joined; nobody dies (the hit that would kill leaves 1
    health and puts you out), the last one standing gets the prize item once and 5 DP;
  formal challenges with DP at stake; the Weekly Duel Cup (sign-ups, a single-elimination bracket fought one duel at
    a time in the pit, "Cup Champion" for the week); last season's titles from duels_season (duels_up.sh season);
  the website's "pit now" and the cup: duels_now rows 4 and 3.
The sparring dummy (npc_openvanilla_sparring_dummy, entry 900105): fights back with bolts to interrupt, a heal to
kick and a crowd control every 20 s; never dies; whispers your DPS, its damage to you and the casts you stopped.
Rules without the game in OpenVanilla/DuelsPitLogic.h (tested by realm/duels/tests/test_pit.cpp).

